     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Christopher,<div><br></div><div>In this case you&#39;ll need to set the scale limits manually - the interplay between coordinates in the data space (i.e. x and y) and coordinates in pixel space (i.e. radius) makes it hard to do everything automatically in this case.</div><div><br></div><div>Hadley<br><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div></div></div>"
